.TH ZERODDS-MQTT-BRIDGED 1 "2026-05-06" "1.0.0-rc.1" "ZeroDDS Manual"
.SH NAME
zerodds-mqtt-bridged \- DDS to MQTT 5 bridge daemon
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B zerodds-mqtt-bridged
[\fB\-c\fR \fIFILE\fR | \fB\-\-config\fR \fIFILE\fR]
[\fB\-\-log\-level\fR \fILEVEL\fR]
[\fB\-\-validate\-only\fR]
[\fB\-V\fR | \fB\-h\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B zerodds-mqtt-bridged
mirrors DDS topics to MQTT 5 broker topics and vice versa. Implements
.IR zerodds-mqtt-bridge-1.0 (7).
Talks to any MQTT 5 broker (Mosquitto, EMQX, HiveMQ) over TCP/TLS,
auto-reconnects with exponential back-off, supports per-route MQTT QoS
(0/1/2), Retain, MessageExpiry, ContentType and UserProperties.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-c ", " \-\-config =\fIFILE\fR
YAML config; default
.IR /etc/zerodds/mqtt-bridged.yaml .
See
.BR zerodds-mqtt-bridged.yaml (5).
.TP
.BR \-\-log\-level =\fILEVEL\fR
Override log level.
.TP
.BR \-\-validate\-only
Validate config and exit.
.SH SIGNALS
.B SIGTERM
graceful shutdown,
.B SIGHUP
config reload (sessions persist).
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.B ZERODDS_CONFIG ", " RUST_LOG .
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 ok, 64 config error, 69 broker unreachable.
.SH FILES
.I /etc/zerodds/mqtt-bridged.yaml ", " /var/log/zerodds/mqtt-bridged.log .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR zerodds-mqtt-bridged.yaml (5),
.BR mosquitto (8).
.SH STANDARDS
MQTT v5 (OASIS), DDS 1.4, RTPS 2.5.
.SH AUTHORS
ZeroDDS Contributors <release@zerodds.org>.
